    "title": "At least five Ukrainian drones shot down over Voronezh Region",
    "text": "VORONEZH, September 11. /TASS/. More than five Ukrainian drones were shot down over Russia’s Voronezh Region bordering Ukraine, no one was hurt, the region’s governor, Alexander Guselv, said.\n\"During the night, air defense forces detected and eliminated more than five unmanned aerial vehicles in four districts of the region. No one was hurt,\" he wrote on his Telegram channel.",
